{"decisions":[{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaQualitySelect.request","verdict":"correct","target":"Solicitar la versión {quality}.","confidence":"high","reason":"Gender agreement error: 'versión' is feminine, so it requires 'la', not 'el'. Word order is also more natural in Spanish."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaQualitySelect.select","verdict":"correct","target":"Usar {quality} para la reproducción.","confidence":"high","reason":"The source is an imperative instruction ('Use...'), but the target uses the first-person indicative ('Uso...'). It should be the infinitive or imperative to match the UI command context."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaQualitySelect.selectQuality","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaQualitySelect.unavailable","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.addCollection","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.addNamed","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.busy","verdict":"correct","target":"El estado de la colección de {server} está cargando o actualizando.","confidence":"high","reason":"The translation 'estado de recogida' is a mistranslation of 'collection state' (likely confusing 'collection' with 'pickup/recogida'). It should be 'colección'. The word order is also awkward."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.empty","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.error","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.errorTitle","verdict":"correct","target":"Colecciones del servidor de medios no disponibles","confidence":"high","reason":"The source 'Media Server Collections' refers to the feature/section, not the server itself. The target 'Media Server Collections No disponible' leaves English words and has incorrect gender agreement ('No disponible' should be 'No disponibles' if referring to collections, or rephrased). A natural Spanish UI title would be 'Colecciones del servidor de medios no disponibles' or similar."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.help","verdict":"correct","target":"Elija una colección compartida existente de {server} para añadir o eliminar toda esta serie. Los episodios seleccionados no se agregan por separado.","confidence":"high","reason":"The phrase 'un compartido existente {server} colección' is ungrammatical and word-for-word. It should be 'una colección compartida existente de {server}'."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.limit","verdict":"correct","target":"La lista de colecciones de {server} excede el límite soportado. No se ofrece lista parcial.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Lista de recogida' is a mistranslation of 'collection list'. It should be 'lista de colecciones'. The article placement 'El {server} La lista' is also incorrect."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.link","verdict":"correct","target":"Vincule su propia cuenta de {server} antes de cambiar sus colecciones.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Enlace a su propio {server} cuenta' is ungrammatical. 'Enlace' is a noun (link) or verb (link), but the structure is broken. It should be 'Vincule su cuenta de {server}' (Link your {server} account)."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.missing","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.permission","verdict":"correct","target":"Tu cuenta vinculada de {server} no tiene permiso para gestionar estas colecciones compartidas.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Tu relación {server} account' is a broken mix of Spanish and English. It should be 'Tu cuenta vinculada de {server}'."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.removeNamed","verdict":"correct","target":"Eliminar de {name}","confidence":"high","reason":"The source is 'Remove from {name}'. The target 'Retirar {name}' means 'Remove {name}' (the object), missing the preposition 'de' (from). It should be 'Eliminar de {name}' or 'Quitar de {name}'."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.retry","verdict":"correct","target":"Recarga la membresía de la colección desde tu cuenta de servidor de medios vinculada. Esto no repite una acción de añadir o eliminar.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Acción agregada o elimina' is ungrammatical. It should be 'acción de añadir o eliminar' (add or remove action)."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerCollectionButton.unavailable","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.addFavorites","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.addHelp","verdict":"correct","target":"Añadir toda esta serie a tu {server} {list}. Las temporadas y episodios seleccionados no se agregan por separado.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Estaciones' is a mistranslation of 'seasons' (TV seasons). It should be 'temporadas'."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.addWatchlist","verdict":"correct","target":"Añadir a la lista de seguimiento","confidence":"high","reason":"'Watchlist' is a specific UI term often translated as 'lista de seguimiento' or 'lista de deseos' in media contexts. Leaving it as 'Watchlist' is inconsistent with other translations like 'lista de vigilancia' used elsewhere. 'Lista de seguimiento' is a standard, natural term."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.failed","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.failedTitle","verdict":"correct","target":"Estado guardado del servidor de medios no disponible","confidence":"high","reason":"The source 'Media Server Saved State' is a technical status. The target leaves English words and has awkward phrasing. 'Estado guardado del servidor de medios no disponible' is a clear, natural Spanish translation."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.linkHelp","verdict":"correct","target":"Vincule su propia cuenta de {server} antes de guardar esta serie.","confidence":"high","reason":"Same issue as MediaServerCollectionButton.link: 'Enlace a su propio {server} cuenta' is ungrammatical. Should be 'Vincule su cuenta de {server}'."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.missingHelp","verdict":"correct","target":"Esta serie no se pudo encontrar en el catálogo de {server} al que tienes acceso.","confidence":"high","reason":"'No puede ser igualada' is a literal, awkward translation of 'could not be matched'. 'No se pudo encontrar' (could not be found) is the natural UI phrasing. 'Su acceso {server} catálogo' is also ungrammatical."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.pendingHelp","verdict":"correct","target":"El estado guardado de {server} está cargando o actualizando.","confidence":"high","reason":"'El {server} estado salvado' is ungrammatical word order. It should be 'El estado guardado de {server}'."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.removeFavorites","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.removeHelp","verdict":"correct","target":"Quitar toda esta serie de su {server} {list}. Esto no elimina los medios ni cambia su lista de seguimiento de Seerr.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Medios de comunicación' is a mistranslation of 'media' (as in media files/content). It should be 'medios' or 'contenidos'. 'Lista de vigilancia' is inconsistent with the preferred 'lista de seguimiento' for Watchlist."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.removeWatchlist","verdict":"correct","target":"Eliminar de la lista de seguimiento","confidence":"high","reason":"Consistency with 'addWatchlist' correction. 'Lista de vigilancia' is less natural than 'lista de seguimiento' for this context."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MediaServerWatchlistButton.retry","verdict":"correct","target":"Cargue el estado guardado desde su cuenta de servidor de medios. Esto no repite una acción de añadir o eliminar.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Acción agregada o elimina' is ungrammatical. Should be 'acción de añadir o eliminar'."},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MetadataAttribution.label","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MediaDetails.MetadataAttribution.licenseInformation","verdict":"keep"}]}
